        "title": "MagSafe Monday: The ESR OmniLock mount proves MagSafe is not just for charging",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/29/esr-omnilock-for-magsafe-car-mount/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/ESR-Omnilock-1.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">MagSafe is typically known for charging only, but there are use cases for it as just a mounting technology/use case. If you don’t want to charge your iPhone in your car or you have a wired CarPlay setup, you might want to use it just for mounting. That’s what the ESR OmniLock for MagSafe Car Mount is designed to do. Let’s take a look.</p>",
