        "title": "9to5Mac Overtime 070: The Siri Redemption Tour",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/26/9to5mac-overtime-070-the-siri-redemption-tour/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/Overtime-070.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Is Siri really good this time? Fernando and Jeff talk about some of their favorite iOS 27 beta features, along with a deep dive into the key new Siri AI features, changes, updates, and optimizations.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/guides/9to5mac-overtime/\">9to5Mac Overtime</a> is a weekly video-first podcast exploring fun and interesting observations in the Apple ecosystem, featuring 9to5Mac’s Fernando Silva &amp; Jeff Benjamin. <a href=\"https://apple.co/4bahT89\">Subscribe to Overtime via Apple Podcasts</a> and our <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/9to5mac?sub_confirmation=1\">YouTube channel</a> for more.</p>",
