        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/29/openclaw-just-launched-an-official-app-for-iphone-details-here/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/openclaw.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Remember Clawdbot, the effort to put AI models to work as agents? Clawdbot eventually became OpenClaw and gained OpenAI’s support. Now there’s an official iPhone (and Android) app for OpenClaw for the first time.</p>",
