        "title": "Apple just announced its first film this year with a theatrical release",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/26/apple-just-announced-its-first-film-this-year-with-a-theatrical-release/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/12/apple-tv-logo-mountains.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple had a major theatrical hit last year with F1. But so far in 2026, all of Apple’s new movies have skipped theaters. Now, the company has <a href=\"https://www.apple.com/tv-pr/originals/tenzing/\">announced</a> that the forthcoming Tenzing will get a limited theatrical debut.</p>",
