        "title": "Apple now sells refurbished MacBook Neo, but you probably shouldn’t buy it",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/26/apple-now-sells-refurbished-macbook-neo-but-you-probably-shouldnt-buy-it/",
